                              sysc-lock installer                               
╭────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────╮
│  Install into /home/test/.local                                            │
│  Source: /src/sysc-lock/build/sysc-lock                                    │
│                                                                            │
│  Will write:                                                               │
│    /home/test/.local/bin/sysc-lock                                         │
│    /home/test/.local/share/systemd/user/sysc-lock-session.service          │
│                                                                            │
│  Change with --prefix PATH. Nothing is enabled or started; PAM and config  │
│  are untouched.                                                            │
╰────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────╯

                 Enter: Install  •  Esc: Back  •  Ctrl+C: Quit                  
